Package: didsuiteR
Title: Native Difference-in-Differences Comparison Harness
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Matthew D.", "Webb", email="matt.webb@carleton.ca", role=c("aut","cre"))
Description: Runs independently installed R difference-in-differences estimators
    through an explicit comparison contract. Provides treatment validation,
    shared assignments, complete physical delete-cluster jackknives, randomization
    inference and isolated per-method failures. Development software with
    documented unsupported combinations, not a universal certification.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils, digest, jsonlite
Suggests: fastrcsdid, fasttwfeR, fastdid2sR, fastbjsR, fastflexR,
    faststackedR, fastlpdidR, suiteundidR, suitedidintR

